<title>PHILIPPINES: Alaska nine-mth net at 60 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Alaska nine-mth net at 60 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippines' Alaska Milk said on Monday it posted a net income of 60 million pesos in the first nine months of the year, down from 170 million pesos in the same period last year.</p>
<p>Revenues went up by 4.5 percent to 1.62 billion pesos from 1.55 billion pesos, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>No other details were available.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
